    "status": "validated",
    "scope": "Native BODY artwork, source action choreography, alpha separation and manually reviewed foot pivots; not confirmation of combat mechanics.",
    "sourceSha256": "8eb97e8038899ff9d7f9967b804fa00701f63722035339cc9a74000212048c6f",
    "notes": [
      "Six independently articulated drawings for each facing, with preparation, equipment action and recovery.",
      "Feet and complete weapon tips visually inspected; all six source cells per orientation have clear alpha gutters and zero visible border pixels.",
      "One fixed body reference per native page, no per-pose fitting.",
      "Horizontal pivots manually reviewed between actual supporting feet; vertical candidates reviewed as feet, not weapon tips.",
      "Original PNG copied byte-identically. No mirror, rigging, crop rewrite, chroma cleanup or pixel editing.",
      "BODY-only visual sequence: source mechanical phases and inventory/duel synchronization remain separate.",
      "BODY-only aimed-shoulder posture, bracing, recoil absorption and same-facing return, with exactly one caster on continuous pedestal bolted to pauldron. Turret starts already aligned; body alignment is shown through stance/shoulder changes. Charge/muzzle flash/plasma projectile are deliberately absent from BODY and require separate entity/effect integration. These drawings do not implement an attack, projectile, cost or guarantee. Right recoil was redrawn with horizontal head and visible mount, avoiding the prior hidden turret.",
      "Two independent pages preserve six real stages per direction; every admitted PNG remains byte-identical to imagegen output."
    ]
  },
